[{"title":"灵谷山","author":"曾季狸","text":"旧闻伯子记，已得灵谷名。\n隐然望此州，奇胜称山灵。\n悬崖泻瀑布，如高屋建瓴。\n乔松数十丈，下有千岁苓。\n仄足行鸟道，势欲抟青冥。\n仙事虽渺茫，幽讨未忘情。\n高秋八月后，择胜来经行。\n黄冠两三人，淡然亦忘形。\n烟霞到几席，爽气来户庭。\n瘦筇閒指点，老瓦同注倾。\n惭非换鹅手，不敢临黄庭。\n或可联石鼎，未必让弥明。\n重阳无十日，黄菊渐向荣。\n佳哉此天气，一笑未易营。\n但愿脚力健，年年此寻盟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":596,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"罗汉石","author":"曾季狸","text":"吾闻大幻师，种种示方便。\n虽于土石中，神力亦周遍。\n君看此翠琅，乃有罗汉面。\n殷勤作礼相，形质皆可辨。\n初观顶相殊，次观双足现。\n僧袍如轻绡，风举势转旋。\n得非方广尊，影落此石片。\n千年磨不尽，若坚金百炼。\n我来一瞻敬，赞叹未曾见。\n摩挲谛玩久，欲去反留恋。\n叮咛善守护，尊者俱神变。\n会当清夜阑，神光照金殿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":597,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鸣玉泉","author":"曾季狸","text":"何人邀我来，白昼朝钧天。\n千官正杂沓，佩有苍玉悬。\n冲牙互击触，远韵声泠然。\n律吕相应和，宫徵更相宣。\n应笑居鄛人，玉斗空碎捐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":598,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秦女行","author":"曾季狸","text":"妾家家世居淮海，郎罢声名传海内。\n自从贬死古藤州，门户凋零三十载。\n可怜生长深闺里，耳濡目染知文字。\n亦尝强学谢娘诗，未敢女子称博士。\n年长以来逢世乱，黄头鲜卑来入汉。\n妾身亦复堕兵间，往事不堪回首看。\n飘然一身逐胡儿，被驱不异犬与鸡。\n奔驰万里向沙漠，天长地久无还期。\n北风萧萧易水寒，雪花席地经燕山。\n千杯虏酒安能醉，一曲琵琶不忍弹。\n吞声饮恨从谁诉，偶然信口题诗句。\n眼前有路可还乡，马上无人容我去。\n诗成吟罢只茫然，岂意汉地能流传。\n当时情绪亦可想，至今闻者犹悲酸。\n忆昔中郎有女子，亦陷虏中垂一纪。\n暮年不料逢阿瞒，厚币赎之归故里。\n惜哉此女不得如，终竟老死留穹庐。\n空馀诗话传悽恻，不减胡笳十八拍。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":599,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"积翠楼 其二","author":"曾季狸","text":"少日便怀丘壑情，看山看水饱曾经。\n如今积翠楼头望，看尽江南未了青。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":600,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宿正觉寺","author":"曾季狸","text":"古寺荒凉甚，秋风更飒然。\n殿焚犹有础，僧老不知年。\n但可扶藜至，无因假榻眠。\n钟鱼久寂寞，谁施一囊钱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":601,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅花","author":"曾季狸","text":"桃李艳阳态，笑我不入时。\n松竹贫贱交，却是同襟期。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":602,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"跃马泉","author":"曾季狸","text":"山灵从何来，崩腾跃万马。\n初疑夫差军，水犀光照夜。\n又疑阏于战，声撼武安马。\n森然毛骨竦，舌拄不能下。\n对此神骖姿，可以一战霸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":603,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"疏山","author":"曾季狸","text":"来往疏山四十年，主人与客两华颠。\n此心不改澄河见，往事休论过鸟然。\n无复仙舟遗迹在，空馀矮叔一灯传。\n危亭独上穷登眺，古木苍藤绕暮烟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":604,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雷公保国寺画壁","author":"曾季狸","text":"我游保国三十年，昔者童稚今华颠。\n僧非昔人屋亦改，仰视乔木皆参天。\n惟馀画壁屹相向，尘封蛛网犹依然。\n空王龙钟曳杖立，弥勒游戏挑囊眠。\n不知寺已几兴废，独此经久无变迁。\n我来摩挲三太息，欲去不忍空留连。\n丁宁老僧为守护，慎勿破壁随云烟。\n作诗仍以示来者，此诗此画当俱传。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":605,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其六","author":"曾季狸","text":"朝来蟹眼方新试，昨夜灯花早得知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":606,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"曾季狸","text":"悠悠造物何所为，贤愚共滞令人悲。\n男儿不恨功名晚，功名必在老大时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":607,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"曾季狸","text":"好事不知谁尔汝，还能郭索到樽前。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":608,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其七","author":"曾季狸","text":"惟有山茶殊奈久，独能探月占春风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":609,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其四","author":"曾季狸","text":"远及水中蟹，直以投菹醢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":610,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其三","author":"曾季狸","text":"甘餐不美鸩，毒终非可戒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":611,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其五","author":"曾季狸","text":"故人怜我贫，走送不待买。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":612,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"清明日赐新火","author":"曾易简","text":"令节传龙蜡，君恩赐近臣。\n乍燃烟尚短，初出焰犹新。\n照耀王侯第，欢呼里巷民。\n谁知蓬荜下，还有聚萤人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":613,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"妙庭观","author":"曾治凤","text":"来访双成宅，溪流绕故山。\n玉真归帝所，金鼎落人间。\n云气生窗户，松声记佩环。\n神仙在何处，且得片时閒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":614,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"妙庭观","author":"曾表勋","text":"小溪一曲绕山绿，虎绕龙蟠记丹熟。\n空想云軿佩玉鸣，夜深屋角风吹竹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":615,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"失调名","author":"曾诞","text":"草草山林职事，厌厌罢相情怀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":616,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"月下笛 帘下","author":"曾隶","text":"绣额云横，银钩月小，绿杨庭院。\n疏明满幅，永昼未忺高卷。\n爱空纹、巧匀曲波，弄晴日色花阴转。\n任筛金影碎，轻敲檐玉，碍双飞燕。\n凝见。\n窗留篆影，六曲雕阑，翠深绛浅。\n香风暗度，不隔娇松莺啭。\n似无情、重雾下垂，嫩桃想像添笑脸。\n望瑶阶、窣地双鸳，注盼金莲远。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":617,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"选冠子","author":"曾栋","text":"曙色开晴，轻飔敷暖，日影才经檐角。\n倦来芳径，且倚阑干，触地新愁粘著。\n长日如年，可堪恨雨丝丝，梦云漠漠。\n见鸣禽递响，乳莺梳翅，痴愁方觉。\n凝望处，初绿呈新，陈柯拆旧，忘了一春归却。\n不伤花老，只怕花开，解使朱须销铄。\n宝扇轻摇，乱抛花片教飞，迎风低掠。\n忍重携素手，骤觉一分瘦落。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":618,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"浣溪沙","author":"曾栋","text":"落日蒸红山欲烧。\n短筇行药过山腰。\n松声隐隐晚来潮。\n矮树依岩无败叶，梅花当路少全梢。\n水村时有短长桥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":619,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题汪水云诗卷","author":"曾顺孙","text":"道人东鲁旧儒生，短褐翛然独自行。\n禾黍离离悲故国，风沙漠漠度长城。\n琴音不忍移南操，诗卷犹能续北征。\n如此金台君拂袖，水天云阔去留轻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":620,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赋杨妃袜","author":"曾原一","text":"万骑西行驻马嵬，凌波曾此堕尘埃。\n谁知一掬香罗小，踏转开元宇宙来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":621,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寺中侨居","author":"曾原一","text":"懒出前山去，得闲唯访僧。\n窗寒依瘦石，屋老络枯藤。\n赴饭听堂鼓，看书傍佛灯。\n西南有孤塔，扶杖亦时登。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":622,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"金精山","author":"曾原一","text":"散策深寻紫翠边，雨馀林密意苍然。\n玄崖拥路奇千叠，邃洞扃抽自一天。\n殿古尚存唐岁月，地灵疑带汉风烟。\n斜阳欲趁归樵路，倚杖更听云外泉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":623,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东华山","author":"曾原一","text":"行尽青山路，楼居傍石安。\n环云疑世隔，弯沼倒涵山。\n瀑近晴如雨，岩深暑亦寒。\n道人弄刀镊，怪我鬓毛斑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":624,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"同戴石屏十人重游分韵得凿字即席赋","author":"曾原一","text":"线径盘邅回，老壁出参错。\n洞深路欲无，且进还悸愕。\n太虚堕滓液，有此奇伟作。\n芮也劳斧斤，此语失之凿。\n斗崖湿生云，泉杂云影落。\n殿头何时仙，怡然骑木鹤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":625,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"作歌咏苏云卿","author":"曾原一","text":"东湖湖面波渺瀰，东湖岸上春土肥。\n先生锄云明月晓，种来蔬甲今成畦。\n把茅萧萧环四壁，此身不愿人间识。\n乾坤清夷那复知，寸心杳渺黄尘隔。\n故人子房今九云，交情不断江湖滨。\n江西使漕却驺骑，故作敲门问字人。\n黄金百镒笺一幅，多谢春风到茅屋。\n君为使者吾邦民，见君容我更樵服。\n故人与我情重哉，君且归矣明当来。\n明朝启扉人不见，黄金不动书不开。\n使者持书三太息，封书径上黄扉侧。\n翩翩鹤驭云冥冥，空向湖山访行迹。\n向来桐江严子陵，曾得故人双眼青。\n芒鞋却踏京华路，太史惊誇说客星。\n先生得书掉头去，并此湖光不回顾。\n梦夫孀妇截髻鬟，亦有老大闺中女。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":626,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"金精歌","author":"曾原一","text":"玄龙捲雨翻东溟，万华变灭如轻尘。\n雹拳破瓦万甲疾，祇恐天地今无春。\n东来一马当轩下，云叶眵剥天痕青。\n云开衡岳韩子到，此事恍惚今难凭。\n桃源有路不可入，桃花影绝那得寻。\n喳喳鹊鸣拔鸟起，岂子伟语曰沧溟。\n联骑瘦蹇踏脆绿，见者谓我椒庭人。\n瑶琴飞响暗雪瀑，杰句泣画逃山精。\n胸蟠玉虹世李白，笔舞铁锁今颜卿。\n飞仙遗章出天韵，引觞清酌球琳鸣。\n泉淙淙兮灵鼓，山崇崇兮太古。\n神明有舍炳万象，何处人间非紫府。\n灵根晔晔贯元气，瞬睫蓬莱无弱水。\n云褷褷，露泚泚。\n米珠簸兮方秤，橘社同兮舟里。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":627,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题贤女祠","author":"曾原一","text":"翻手作云覆手雨，刘翁乃尔女如许。\n飘飘上下随春风，妾身肯似章台絮。\n门前江水深更深，沈沈此水明妾心。\n后来志士为感慨，过此往事成悲吟。\n嗟嗟许蔡复许吴，女吴绝蔡成二夫。\n此时哀泪苦几谏，翁意或可还其初。\n吴家箱币罗堂前，女兮脉脉胡不言。\n后来吴郎傥不死，清祠未必能江边。\n女今贤明照天宇，翁也反覆闻千古。\n许吴之日回此天，女贤翁否俱无传。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":628,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题瘦马歌","author":"曾原一","text":"少尽其力老弃之，可怜骨立行步迟。\n何心更惜乾障泥，病夫醉兀枯行枝。\n主家刍豆岂不饱，吾宁忍死不愿肥。\n肥时无奈人争骑，骑时鞭打无休时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":629,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"小重山","author":"曾原一","text":"薄雪初消银月单。\n疏疏浮竹影、矮红阑。\n梅花梦事落孤山。\n禁人处，霜重鼓声寒。\n留取晓来看。\n斑帘低小阁、烛花残。\n一帆明月去沧湾。\n空相忆，雪浪月痕翻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":630,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"菩萨蛮","author":"曾原一","text":"淡黄斜日留汀草。\n檐低半露遥岑小。\n病眼不禁愁。\n阑干无数秋。\n雁声何处落。\n旧梦还惊觉。\n风重葛衣单。\n深山吹笛寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":631,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谒金门","author":"曾原一","text":"梅粉褪。\n点点雨声春恨。\n半吐桃花芳意嫩。\n草痕青寸寸。\n把酒花边低问。\n莫解寒深红损。\n等待春风晴得稳。\n琵琶重整顿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":632,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游金精次韵","author":"曾原郕","text":"鲸奔兽骇罗群峰，晴岚湿雾深几重。\n世言番君勇穿石，此事荒唐敢云实。\n仙凡聚散那得知，祗今流水篆元之。\n冲升坛在肯回顾，木鹤痴情飞不去。\n五诗遗笔写元云，残碑记载心何勤。\n谁通一罅山前路，车马尘埃了朝暮。\n刘郎想自天台来，步步锦绣连云开。\n千崖万壑玲珑窍，今日重逢应一笑。\n苍苍石鼓青云齐，名章合刻悬崖西。\n可怜一觉邯郸炊，胸中五色蟠晴霓。\n此桃种在清虚处，不断尘埃笑崔护。\n人世从教隔古今，洞府何从认新故。\n我发白矣骨尚凡，悠悠空老兹山间。\n酌泉祈仙会当见，曾有麻姑访王远。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":633,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"八声甘州 东阳岩","author":"曾原郕","text":"问岩云朵朵为谁飞，向来读何书。\n道江南名宦，掉头勿顾，彩服归与。\n无限山中风物，今古属潜夫。\n渺渺辽天鹤，应费招呼。\n谩说缁巾缟带，与豸冠犀剑，忧乐如何。\n渐桥横采石，国步已趑趄。\n想归来、顿成憔悴，叹季鹰、闻早忆莼鲈。\n丹泉冷，崖钟绝响，夕照啼乌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":634,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"木兰花慢 甘泉岩","author":"曾原郕","text":"断崖抛雪瀑，又潜溜、入山跟。\n听暗壁潺湲，山中紫雾，山下红云。\n当年七僧甚处，但空馀、老刹靠嶙峋。\n底事神粮不幻，翠窝剩积香尘。\n纷纷。\n结社种莲人。\n名氏已无闻。\n看银书般若，金陵故国，斜敕空存。\n争得十虚销殒，为让皇、冤魄脱沈沦。\n往事犹堪一笑，岩花乱点乌巾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":635,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"舒州寄王介甫","author":"曾宰","text":"官居隐几望灊山，不似茅檐旧日闲。\n顾我尘沙添白发，怜君道路失朱颜。\n江涵秋老鲈鱼美，岸入春风荻笋斑。\n此味纵佳吾不乐，惟思一马返乡关。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":636,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽和靖先生 其一","author":"曾班","text":"凛凛河南已百年，维公高行继前贤。\n早施绛帐崇师席，晚入金华侍讲筵。\n斯道未传今逝矣，彼苍难问竟茫然。\n回思昨日论交地，不见牙签列简编。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":637,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽和靖先生 其二","author":"曾班","text":"道直心无愧，师严貌有威。\n上方虚席待，公忽挂冠归。\n王室怀元老，天星掩少微。\n簪绅竞相吊，奚独我心悲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":638,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"崇觉寺","author":"曾致尧","text":"水深花影地莓苔，春色烘人若不开。\n走报鸰原无别事，远将歌管酒壶来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":639,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东林寺","author":"曾致尧","text":"江南杨柳春，日暖地无尘。\n渡口惊新雨，夜来生白蘋。\n晴沙鸣乳雁，芳草醉游人。\n向晚前山路，谁家赛水神。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":640,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题军山徐秀才居","author":"曾致尧","text":"买断军峰不计钱，屋前屋后水潺潺。\n青春花发帘帷外，白日云浮栋宇间。\n金鼎欲成红气溢，玉芝初种紫苗悭。\n未知桃熟先生醉，鹤驭何人得往还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":641,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题刘居士江楼","author":"曾致尧","text":"刘八江楼雅，诗家不易言。\n春风花对岸，夜月水当轩。\n帘捲青山入，窗开白浪翻。\n画来须妙手，梦去亦清魂。\n吟称云初满，登宜雪正繁。\n鱼龙惯灯火，鸥鹭识琴樽。\n波动檐摇影，潮回砌露痕。\n势雄邻碧落，景好怕黄昏。\n未许凡踪到，宁教俗态存。\n主人凭槛处，寥廓共谁论。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":642,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"望京楼","author":"曾致尧","text":"望京楼上望，望久思踟蹰。\n境土连江徼，人家匝海隅。\n隔山川隐映，近郭水萦纡。\n雨过风腥槛，潮来岸浸芦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":643,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题义门胡氏华林书院","author":"曾致尧","text":"华林书院集群英，讲诵兴来里巷荣。\n宾友尽为文苑客，子孙多是帝门生。\n九理下诏亲旌义，四相留诗自著名。\n致使举家在霄汉，更将忠孝答皇朝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":644,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"曾致尧","text":"沙鹭窥吟榻，风蝉入座隅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":645,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其三","author":"曾致尧","text":"更无尘土当轩起，只有松萝绕槛生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":646,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"曾致尧","text":"云昏迷侯馆，树缺辨江湖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":647,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"丑奴儿/采桑子","author":"曾乾曜","text":"蓦地厮看时。\n赤怕那、迪功郎儿。\n气岸昂昂因权县，厅子叫道，宣教请后，有无限威仪。\n先自不相知。\n取奉著、刬地胡挥。\n甚时得归京里去，两省八座，横行正任，却会嫌卑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":648,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"草意","author":"曾唯仲","text":"辇路凄凄隔岁华，王孙望断怨天涯。\n庭空烟雨无人管，那有閒情衬落花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":649,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"减字木兰花 题温日观葡萄卷","author":"曾寅孙","text":"生绡蜀茧。\n笔底墨云飞一片。\n点点秋腴。\n收得骊龙颔下珠。\n兴来一扫。\n惜处有时悭似宝。\n露叶烟条。\n几度西风吹不凋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":650,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书事十绝 其九","author":"曾惇","text":"淮畔风尘自此清，斯人还喜见升平。\n田家尽说今年好，要雨雨来晴便晴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":651,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书事十绝 其四","author":"曾惇","text":"淮上州州尽灭烽，今年方喜得和戎。\n问谁整顿乾坤了，学语儿童道相公。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":652,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书事十绝 其五","author":"曾惇","text":"连营貔虎气如云，听诏人人愿立勋。\n沔鄂蕲黄一千里，更无人说岳家军。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":653,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书事十绝 其十","author":"曾惇","text":"百丈岢峨贾客船，张帆打鼓下长川。\n路人指点几垂泪，江道无来十六年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":654,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书事十绝 其一","author":"曾惇","text":"黄泥坂下雪犹深，赤壁矶头江欲平。\n驿吏西来闻好语，蕃人已出蔡州城。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":655,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书事十绝 其六","author":"曾惇","text":"田父今年作社频，边头闻见一番新。\n官军不斫人家树，各自持钱去买薪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":656,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书事十绝 其三","author":"曾惇","text":"吾君见事若通神，兵柄收还号令新。\n裴度只今真圣相，勒碑十丈可无人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":657,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书事十绝 其八","author":"曾惇","text":"村村准拟十分禾，老稚扶携笑且歌。\n租税况今黄纸放，阳城元自拙催科。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":658,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]